iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_01_on_explorer_02.md:81:1. Formalize the spike counterexample as a proposition with an all-horizons regret bound.
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_01_on_explorer_02.md:82:2. Decide whether the target theorem is instance-level, Bayesian/process-aware, or uniform/minimax.
