iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:68:  Relevance: related delayed/composite feedback model.
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:69:
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:70:## Recommended Next Checks
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:71:
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:72:1. Fix the quantifiers: instance-aware, distribution-free, minimax over a class, or universal over all processes.
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:73:2. Write the spike counterexample as a formal lemma with an exact regret bound `R(T) <= O(S_{n-1})` for `S_n <= T < S_{n+1}`.
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:74:3. Verify the delayed expert theorem under the exact feedback model: full price observation, bounded truncation delay, and adaptive versus oblivious rewards.
iterations/iter_001/idea_03/critic_02_on_explorer_02.md:75:4. Try a two-environment lower bound where histories agree up to delay `H` but optimal fixed quotes differ; this targets unpredictable tail mass rather than raw tail mass.

